\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93The person you become is hidden inside the work you\'92re avoiding.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Comfort has never introduced anyone to greatness.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Your future is quietly watching what you do today.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Every excuse sounds reasonable until someone else succeeds anyway.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Discipline is choosing what you want most over what you want now.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 Abraham Lincoln (often attributed, disputed)\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
