\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93You cannot cheat your future self.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93No one is coming to rescue your potential.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Talent is rented. Rent is due every day.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 J. J. Watt\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	10	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Nothing changes if nothing changes.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 Common saying\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	11	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Dreams don\'92t die. They get abandoned.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	12	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93The clock never asks whether you felt motivated.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	13	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Your habits are voting for the person you\'92ll become.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 James Clear (paraphrased idea)\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	14	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93The cost of discipline is always less than the cost of regret.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	15	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93You are always practicing something.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	16	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Average is built one comfortable decision at a time.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	17	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Action creates confidence. Waiting creates doubt.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	18	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\'93Your competition isn\'92t resting because you\'92re tired.\'94\uc0\u8232 \'95 AXOM Original\
